msgid "All right, Rikiya. It's time for you to go back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr "...Già."

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Come on, I'll take you over to a taxi. If we leave now, we\r\n"
"should be able to get you on the next flight down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "It's okay, Aniki. I can go on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Barely any time has passed since the Snake Flower Triad\r\n"
"tried to murder you, Rikiya. You shouldn't be out by\r\n"
"yourself. Not yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "...Yeah, I guess you're right. Let's go."
msgstr ""

